### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 8. Add your own requests here for the rules in ASSIGNMENT.md

### 9. Booking in the past (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2020-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 10. Booking longer than 4 hours (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-12T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-12T15:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 11. Booking exactly 4 hours (expected: 201)
# @name createFourHourBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-13T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-13T14:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 12. Booking starting exactly now (expected: 201 when sent with a fixed current UTC timestamp)
# Replace both dates with the same current UTC timestamp immediately before sending.
# @name createNowBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-14T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-14T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 13. Double cancel (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 14. API version from query string (expected: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}?api-version=1.0

### 15. API version from header (expected: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
X-Api-Version: 1.0
